Education: University of Dhaka

Source: Wikipedia — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mobarak_Hossain_Khan$b$, 'en', NULL, $b$Singer, Musicologist, Writer$b$, NULL, NULL, 'year', 'day');
